{"seq":1,"slug":"in-house-cash-pool","title":"内部银行与资金池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/treasury-ops-liquidity/in-house-cash-pool","wordCount":2281,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部银行与资金池\">内部银行与资金池</h1><p>一个跨境平台通常有多个法律实体：一个在开曼或新加坡的控股主体、若干个各国持牌主体（收单牌照、支付牌照）、若干运营主体。每个实体有独立账户、独立报表、独立的监管约束，但它们的钱是同一盘生意赚来的。<strong>内部银行</strong>（in-house bank）就是把这盘钱在集团内部高效调度、同时不违反每个实体各自约束的那层抽象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么需要内部银行\">核心概念：为什么需要内部银行</h2><p>没有内部银行时，资金的流动方式是：子公司 A 需要钱，找外部银行借款；子公司 B 有钱闲置，存外部银行拿存款利率。A 付贷款利率，B 收存款利率，两个利率之间有银行赚的价差。集团整体看，这是一笔纯粹的浪费——把 B 的钱给 A 用，成本应该远低于外部融资。</p>\n<p>内部银行把这个流程内部化：设立一个集团级资金中心（treasury center），各实体在资金中心开立<strong>内部账户</strong>，资金中心向富余实体&quot;吸收存款&quot;、向短缺实体&quot;发放贷款&quot;。外部银行只在集团层面打交道，用于处理净流出与净流入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无内部银行</th>\n<th>有内部银行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>融资来源</td>\n<td>各实体各自对外</td>\n<td>集团内部先轧差，仅净额对外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利息成本</td>\n<td>贷款利率 − 存款利率（价差归银行）</td>\n<td>内部利率（价差留在集团）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金可见性</td>\n<td>各实体各自为政</td>\n<td>集团统一可见头寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规负担</td>\n<td>每个实体独立 KYC/额度</td>\n<td>集中在资金中心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要新增风险</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>内部信用风险、转移定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内部账户与内部利率\">内部账户与内部利率</h2><p>内部银行的核心数据模型是<strong>内部账户</strong>：每个实体在资金中心有一个以资金中心记账币计价的账户，记录该实体对资金中心的净头寸。这个账户不是银行账户，它没有对应的银行账户余额，它是集团内部的债权债务记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE in_house_account (&#10;  ih_account_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES legal_entity(id),&#10;  center_ccy     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  account_kind   TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (account_kind IN (&#39;CURRENT&#39;,&#39;DEPOSIT&#39;,&#39;LOAN&#39;,&#39;PARTICIPATION&#39;)),&#10;  opened_at      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  state          TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN (&#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#39;FROZEN&#39;,&#39;CLOSED&#39;)),&#10;  UNIQUE (entity_id, center_ccy, account_kind)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE ih_transaction (&#10;  ih_txn_id      BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ih_account_id  BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES in_house_account(ih_account_id),&#10;  value_date     DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  ccy            CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  amount         NUMERIC(28,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_applied   NUMERIC(20,10),&#10;  direction      TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (direction IN (&#39;CREDIT&#39;,&#39;DEBIT&#39;)),&#10;  txn_kind       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (txn_kind IN&#10;                   (&#39;FUNDING&#39;,&#39;REPAYMENT&#39;,&#39;INTEREST&#39;,&#39;FX_CONVERSION&#39;,&#39;FEE&#39;,&#39;SWEEP_IN&#39;,&#39;SWEEP_OUT&#39;)),&#10;  source_ref     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> in_house_account</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ih_account_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legal_entity(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  center_ccy     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_kind   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (account_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CURRENT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEPOSIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOAN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTICIPATION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entity_id, center_ccy, account_kind)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ih_transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ih_txn_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ih_account_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_house_account(ih_account_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_date     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ccy            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_applied   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEBIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  txn_kind       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (txn_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FUNDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REPAYMENT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INTEREST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FX_CONVERSION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FEE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SWEEP_IN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SWEEP_OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么内部账户要分-kind\">为什么内部账户要分 kind</h3><p><code>CURRENT</code> 是日常往来的账户（类似活期），<code>DEPOSIT</code> 是富余资金的存放（计息、有期限），<code>LOAN</code> 是短缺时的借款（计息、有还款计划），<code>PARTICIPATION</code> 用于多个实体共同参与某笔资金安排。把它们分开而不是塞进一个账户，是因为它们的<strong>利息计算规则、还款要求、以及转移定价处理都不同</strong>——混在一起会让计息逻辑充满 if-else。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内部利率必须定价且可解释\">内部利率必须定价且可解释</h3><p>内部利率（internal rate）是资金中心向实体吸收资金和发放资金时用的利率。它的定价基准通常是外部市场利率（比如相应期限的银行同业利率或集团加权平均融资成本）加一个调整，调整反映资金中心的运营成本与风险。</p>\n<p><strong>内部利率必须与外部可比、且可被税务解释。</strong> 税务机关会检查集团内部借贷的利率是否在合理区间（独立交易原则，arm&#39;s length principle）——定得过低可能被认定为利润转移并核定利息收入。所以内部利率的每一次变更都要留档，且要能说明它的市场依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计息不能靠-每天算一次\">计息不能靠&quot;每天算一次&quot;</h3><p>内部账户的利息计算要求<strong>按日计息、按实际天数、且要考虑余额变动</strong>。这件事不能用&quot;每日快照余额 × 日利率&quot;来近似，因为同一天内可能有多次余额变化。正确做法是把 <code>ih_transaction</code> 作为唯一真相源，用余额的<strong>分段计算</strong>求利息：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Interest</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Balance</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>DayBasis</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Interest} = \\sum_{i} \\text{Balance}_i \\cdot r \\cdot \\frac{d_i}{\\text{DayBasis}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interest</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DayBasis</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 段余额的持有天数，<code>DayBasis</code> 依币种而定（多数货币用 360 或 365，英镑等用 365）。用 <code>CURRENT</code> 账户的滚动余额 + 利率有效期分段求积分，这样即使利率在月中变更、余额每天变动，计息仍然准确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集团内部轧差-netting\">集团内部轧差（netting）</h2><p>内部银行最有价值的机制是<strong>轧差</strong>：当 A 实体应支付 B 实体 100 万、B 实体应支付 A 实体 80 万时，双方只需结算净额 20 万，而不是两笔各 100 万和 80 万的双向划转。轧差分两种：</p>\n<p><strong>双边轧差（bilateral netting）</strong>：两个实体之间互相轧差。实现简单，但只解决两两之间的重复。</p>\n<p><strong>多边轧差（multilateral netting）</strong>：集团内所有实体的债权债务一次性轧平，每个实体只对资金中心有净头寸（净收或净付），实际资金划转只发生在资金中心与各实体之间，且只划净额。这是集团资金效率的关键——原本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个实体之间可能有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 条划转路径，多边轧差后只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 轧差前 各实体多边互欠&#10;      A1[实体A] --&gt; B1[实体B]&#10;      B1 --&gt; C1[实体C]&#10;      C1 --&gt; A1&#10;      A1 --&gt; D1[实体D]&#10;      D1 --&gt; B1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 轧差后 只与资金中心结算净额&#10;      A2[实体A 净付] --&gt; TC[资金中心]&#10;      B2[实体B 净收] --&gt; TC&#10;      C2[实体C 净收] --&gt; TC&#10;      D2[实体D 净付] --&gt; TC&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 轧差前 各实体多边互欠\n      A1[实体A] --&gt; B1[实体B]\n      B1 --&gt; C1[实体C]\n      C1 --&gt; A1\n      A1 --&gt; D1[实体D]\n      D1 --&gt; B1\n    end\n    subgraph 轧差后 只与资金中心结算净额\n      A2[实体A 净付] --&gt; TC[资金中心]\n      B2[实体B 净收] --&gt; TC\n      C2[实体C 净收] --&gt; TC\n      D2[实体D 净付] --&gt; TC\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"轧差的法律有效性依赖净额结算协议\">轧差的法律有效性依赖净额结算协议</h3><p>多边轧差在<strong>破产</strong>情形下是否有效，取决于集团内是否有有效的净额结算协议（netting agreement）——如果没有，破产管理人可以主张每笔债务独立，轧差无效。所以轧差系统必须与法律文件绑定：每对实体之间存在有效净额结算协议，才能把它们纳入同一个轧差圈。这个约束让&quot;轧差圈&quot;成为一个需要法律确认的实体，而不是一个纯技术分组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轧差不能跨越资本管制\">轧差不能跨越资本管制</h3><p>一个被资本管制的辖区内的实体，其对外净额可能不允许自由划出。所以轧差圈通常按辖区切分，跨境部分单独处理。这与 <a href=\"../cash-position-exposure/multi-account-balance-sweeping\">多区域账户余额归集</a> 里的可归集性判断是同一套账户画像数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资金池的形态与监管差异\">资金池的形态与监管差异</h2><p>资金池（cash pool）是把多个实体的资金合并管理的机制，社区里主要分两种：</p>\n<p><strong>名义现金池（notional cash pooling / notional pool）</strong> 不实际划转资金，只在计息时把各账户余额轧差计算净利息。它的法律风险在于：如果银行把池内余额视为对集团的单一敞口，而这个敞口在破产时可能无法对抗，各辖区的监管处理不同。Basel 框架下银行对这类池子的敞口资本计量有专门要求，这直接影响银行提供 pool 的意愿与定价（来源：BCBS, <em>Basel III: Finalising post-crisis reforms</em>, 2017）。</p>\n<p><strong>实体现金池（physical pooling / ZBA structure）</strong> 真的划转资金，结构清晰但动钱。跨境时受资本管制约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"池化结构的选型受监管而非技术驱动\">池化结构的选型受监管而非技术驱动</h3><p>一个反直觉的事实是：<strong>资金池的技术能力往往不是瓶颈，监管可行性才是</strong>。同一个集团在不同辖区能用的池化结构完全不同，所以资金系统必须把&quot;账户在哪个辖区、受什么约束、属于哪个法律实体&quot;建模成账户画像，而不是假设所有账户都能被统一池化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内部银行的可审计性\">内部银行的可审计性</h2><p>内部银行的每一笔交易都是<strong>关联方交易</strong>，因此它的证据要求比外部交易更高。三条纪律：</p>\n<p>每笔内部交易必须有<strong>业务依据</strong>（因为什么发生的，对应哪笔外部业务或资金计划）、有<strong>定价依据</strong>（用的哪个内部利率、利率的市场基准是什么）、以及有<strong>结算证据</strong>（实际划转了还是账面挂账）。这三条是关联方转让定价文档与审计的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT ih.account_kind,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN t.direction = &#39;CREDIT&#39; THEN t.amount ELSE -t.amount END) AS net_position&#10;FROM ih_transaction t&#10;JOIN in_house_account ih ON ih.ih_account_id = t.ih_account_id&#10;WHERE t.value_date &lt;= DATE &#39;2026-09-30&#39;&#10;GROUP BY ih.account_kind&#10;HAVING SUM(CASE WHEN t.direction = &#39;CREDIT&#39; THEN t.amount ELSE -t.amount END) &lt;&gt; 0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ih</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_position</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ih_transaction t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_house_account ih </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ih</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ih_account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ih_account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ih</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_kind</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内部头寸必须合计为零\">内部头寸必须合计为零</h3><p>一个有力的不变量检查是：<strong>所有内部账户的净头寸按币种加总必须为零</strong>。因为内部账户记录的是集团内部的债权债务，一方的债权必是另一方的债务。这个总和不等于零意味着有一笔内部交易只记了一边——这是一个必须在日结时阻断的错误，而不是留到月末对账时发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内部银行把集团内资金调度内部化，用内部账户记录实体对资金中心的债权债务，仅净额对外融资。</li>\n<li>内部账户按 kind 分层（CURRENT/DEPOSIT/LOAN/PARTICIPATION），因为各自的计息与还款规则不同。</li>\n<li>计息必须用交易流的分段余额求积分，不能用每日快照余额近似；内部利率必须定价可解释以满足转让定价要求。</li>\n<li>多边轧差把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 条划转路径压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条，但它依赖有效的净额结算协议，且不能跨越资本管制辖区。</li>\n<li>池化结构的选型受监管可行性驱动而非技术能力；内部账户净头寸按币种合计必须为零，这是日结阻断级不变量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内部银行与资金池","id":"内部银行与资金池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么需要内部银行","id":"核心概念-为什么需要内部银行"},{"level":2,"text":"内部账户与内部利率","id":"内部账户与内部利率"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么内部账户要分 kind","id":"为什么内部账户要分-kind"},{"level":3,"text":"内部利率必须定价且可解释","id":"内部利率必须定价且可解释"},{"level":3,"text":"计息不能靠\"每天算一次\"","id":"计息不能靠-每天算一次"},{"level":2,"text":"集团内部轧差（netting）","id":"集团内部轧差-netting"},{"level":3,"text":"轧差的法律有效性依赖净额结算协议","id":"轧差的法律有效性依赖净额结算协议"},{"level":3,"text":"轧差不能跨越资本管制","id":"轧差不能跨越资本管制"},{"level":2,"text":"资金池的形态与监管差异","id":"资金池的形态与监管差异"},{"level":3,"text":"池化结构的选型受监管而非技术驱动","id":"池化结构的选型受监管而非技术驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"内部银行的可审计性","id":"内部银行的可审计性"},{"level":3,"text":"内部头寸必须合计为零","id":"内部头寸必须合计为零"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"对冲有效性度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/hedging-instruments/hedge-effectiveness-measure"},"next":{"title":"多币种流动性预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/treasury-ops-liquidity/liquidity-forecast"}}